        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wakaya ku mpata ya Moaba ku mukuna wa Nebo, ku mutu kua Pisega, kuakadi kutangilangana ne Yeleko. Yehowa wakamufila buloba buonso bua Gilada tô ne ku Dana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne buloba buonso bua Nafatale, ne bua Efelayima ne Manashe ne buloba buonso bua Yuda tô ne ku mai manene a ku nyima, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne buloba bua ku Sude, ne mpata wa mu tshibanda tshia Yeleko, musoko wa mabue, tô ne ku Soâ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakamuambila ne, Ebu mbuloba bunakalaya Abalahama ne Isaka ne Yakoba ne, Nembuhe tunkanunuina tuenu, nakukuleshabu ne mesu ebe, kadi wewe kuena usabukaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Mose, muinu wa Yehowa, wakafua mu buloba bua Moaba muakamba Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakamujika mu tshibanda tshia buloba bua Moaba tshiakatangilangana ne Bete-peô; kakuena muntu udi mumanye kudi lukita luandi tô ne ku dituku edi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakafua Mose, yeye wakadi ne bidimu lukama ne makumi abidi: mesu andi kâkadi bileshileshi ne bukole buandi kabuakahua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Isalele bakadila Mose matuku makumi asatu mu mpata wa Moaba; nunku matuku a kudila kua Mose akashika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua, muana wa Nuna, wakadi ne lungenyi munda muandi tente bualu bua Mose wakamutentekasha bianza biandi; ne Bena Isalele bakunvua di diandi, bakenza bu muakambila Yehowa Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku dituku adi kakuena muprofete mukuabo mubike munkatshi mua Bena Isalele bu Mose, wakadi mumanyangane ne Yehowa ku mesu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mu bimanyinu bionso ne mu malu a kukema akamutumina Yehowa bua kuenzeye mu buloba bua Ejipitu, ne bua kuenzela Palo ne bantu bandi bonso ne buloba buandi buonso, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne mu tshianza tshikole, ne mu buowa bunene biakenza Mose ku mesu kua Bena Isalele bonso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
